  "<section class=\"slide\" style=\"background:#080C16\" data-notes=\"I've been using Kiro as a Cloud Architect for almost a year. What I like most isn't that it writes code on its own — it's that it works with me: I guide and plan, it executes, and I stay in the loop watching what it does. Teammate, not autopilot.\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:230.39999999999998px;top:-441.59999999999997px;width:816px;height:672px;background:rgba(11,17,32,0.45);border-radius:50%;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-249.60000000000002px;top:403.20000000000005px;width:720px;height:624px;background:rgba(255,214,102,0.07);border-radius:50%;\"></div><img src=\"assets/g_gancho.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;left:998.4000000000001px;top:213.94856614246066px;width:259.20000000000005px;height:234.50286771507865px;object-fit:contain;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:59.519999999999996px;top:48px;width:1056px;height:38.400000000000006px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:16.00px;color:#FFD666;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2.00px;line-height:1.32;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;\">—  THE HOOK</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:67.19999999999999px;top:148.8px;width:883.1999999999999px;height:86.4px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:48.00px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;line-height:1.06;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;\">AI isn't here to replace you.</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:67.19999999999999px;top:230.39999999999998px;width:883.1999999999999px;height:86.4px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:48.00px;color:#F2C14E;font-weight:700;font-style:italic;line-height:1.06;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;\">It's here to code with you.</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:67.19999999999999px;top:369.6px;width:412.79999999999995px;height:124.80000000000001px;background:rgba(17,26,45,1);border:1px solid #F2657A;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:9.600000000000001px;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:86.4px;top:384px;width:374.4px;height:96px;font-family:var(--font-body);text-align:left;line-height:1.32;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:21.33px;color:#F2657A;font-weight:700;\">Autopilot<br></span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:17.33px;color:#9AA6B8;\">you ask for something and it disappears to vibe-code</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:508.79999999999995px;top:369.6px;width:441.59999999999997px;height:124.80000000000001px;background:rgba(17,26,45,1);border:1.5px solid #D6A537;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:9.600000000000001px;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:528px;top:384px;width:403.20000000000005px;height:96px;font-family:var(--font-body);text-align:left;line-height:1.32;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:21.33px;color:#FFD666;font-weight:700;\">Teammate<br></span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:17.33px;color:#E6EBF2;\">you plan, review, keep the context and reuse what works</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:69.12px;top:523.2px;width:864px;height:38.400000000000006px;font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:18.67px;color:#6E7A8E;font-style:italic;line-height:1.32;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;\">Most people see Kiro as \"an editor with AI\". It's quite a bit more than that.</div></section>",
